    }
  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We are given a matrix.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1300,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 39,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever an original cell contains zero, its complete row and its complete column must become zero.",
      "start_ms": 1740,
      "end_ms": 10040,
      "start_frame": 52,
      "end_frame": 301,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "For this lesson, we will use this matrix.",
      "start_ms": 10800,
      "end_ms": 13300,
      "start_frame": 324,
      "end_frame": 399,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We will use zero -based row and column indices.",
      "start_ms": 13960,
      "end_ms": 17160,
      "start_frame": 419,
      "end_frame": 515,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "There are three original zeros.",
      "start_ms": 17840,
      "end_ms": 19740,
      "start_frame": 535,
      "end_frame": 592,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "One is in the first row, one is in the first column, and one is inside the matrix.",
      "start_ms": 20280,
      "end_ms": 26220,
      "start_frame": 608,
      "end_frame": 787,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, the solution may look obvious.",
      "start_ms": 26830,
      "end_ms": 29900,
      "start_frame": 805,
      "end_frame": 897,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "When we find a zero, why not immediately make that row and column zero?",
      "start_ms": 30580,
      "end_ms": 35640,
      "start_frame": 917,
      "end_frame": 1069,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "The problem is, those writes create new zeros.",
      "start_ms": 36300,
      "end_ms": 40040,
      "start_frame": 1089,
      "end_frame": 1201,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And if our scan later reaches one of those new zeros, we may treat it like an original zero.",
      "start_ms": 40600,
      "end_ms": 47040,
      "start_frame": 1218,
      "end_frame": 1411,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we zero another row and another column, even though they were never supposed to change.",
      "start_ms": 47600,
      "end_ms": 54180,
      "start_frame": 1428,
      "end_frame": 1625,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So we need one important rule.",
      "start_ms": 54180,
      "end_ms": 56780,
      "start_frame": 1625,
      "end_frame": 1703,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Zeros created by us must never become new sources of zeroing.",
      "start_ms": 57640,
      "end_ms": 63340,
      "start_frame": 1729,
      "end_frame": 1900,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "That means we need to preserve the information about the original zeros before our mutations can destroy it.",
      "start_ms": 64060,
      "end_ms": 72640,
      "start_frame": 1922,
      "end_frame": 2179,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's start with the safest possible method.",
      "start_ms": 73540,
      "end_ms": 76280,
      "start_frame": 2206,
      "end_frame": 2288,
      "word_count": 7
    }
  ],
